---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Documentation" description="Yevqo documentation, Termux setup and yevqo.yml deployment configuration.">
  <div class="page-kicker">05 / DOCUMENTATION</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Everything starts<br/><span>with Termux.</span></h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Documentation for the Yevqo Agent, device setup and project workflows. Yevqo is designed around Android and the Termux environment.</p>

  <div class="page-grid">
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">GUIDE 01</span><h2>Android requirements</h2><p>An Android device with enough free storage and memory for the applications you plan to run. Battery optimization and network restrictions may affect long-running services.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">GUIDE 02</span><h2>Termux environment</h2><p>Termux provides a Linux-like shell and package manager without requiring root for many development workflows.</p></article>
    <article class="page-card"><span class="card-index">GUIDE 03</span><h2>Network access</h2><p>Public access depends on your Wi-Fi router, carrier-grade NAT, firewall and network configuration. A tunnel or external host may be needed.</p></article>
  </div>

  <section class="manifest-section" id="yevqo-yml">
    <div class="page-kicker">CONFIGURATION / DEPLOYMENT MANIFEST</div>
    <h2 class="manifest-title">One file for <span>your project.</span></h2>
    <p class="manifest-lead">Place <code>yevqo.yml</code> in your project root. It describes the project runtime, build steps, start command, environment, health checks, artifacts, cache, resource preferences and deployment behavior.</p>
    <div class="manifest-code">
      <div class="code-header"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><b>yevqo.yml</b><small>YEVQO MANIFEST · VERSION 1</small></div>
      <pre><code>version: 1

project:
  name: my-node-app
  root: .
  runtime: nodejs

build:
  provider: custom
  install: npm install
  command: npm run build
  output: dist

run:
  command: npm start
  port: 3000

environment:
  NODE_ENV: production

healthcheck:
  path: /health
  interval: 30s

artifacts:
  include:
    - dist/**
  exclude:
    - node_modules/**

cache:
  enabled: true
  paths:
    - node_modules

resources:
  memory: 512MB

deploy:
  restart: true</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="manifest-grid">
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>01 / PROJECT</span><h3>Project identity</h3><p><code>name</code>, <code>root</code> and <code>runtime</code> describe the project and its working directory.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>02 / BUILD & RUN</span><h3>Build lifecycle</h3><p>Choose the build provider, install and build commands, output directory, start command and application port.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>03 / ENVIRONMENT</span><h3>Runtime settings</h3><p>Declare environment variables and an HTTP health-check endpoint with its check interval.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>04 / ARTIFACTS</span><h3>Build output</h3><p>Define which files should be included in deployment artifacts and which paths should be excluded.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>05 / CACHE</span><h3>Reusable dependencies</h3><p>Enable build caching and list directories that can be reused between builds.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>06 / RESOURCES</span><h3>Resource preferences</h3><p>Declare resource preferences such as memory. Enforcement depends on the capabilities of the Android runtime.</p></article>
      <article class="manifest-card"><span>07 / DEPLOY</span><h3>Deployment behavior</h3><p>Configure deployment lifecycle behavior, including whether the application should restart after deployment.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="manifest-note"><strong>Implementation status:</strong> The current website documents the target manifest format. In the current engine implementation, only <code>project.root</code>, <code>build.provider</code>, <code>build.install</code>, <code>build.command</code>, <code>run.command</code> and <code>run.port</code> are handled. The other fields are part of the planned schema and must not be treated as active runtime behavior yet.</div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-note"><strong>Coming soon:</strong> Agent installation, pairing, project creation, deployment, logs, backups and troubleshooting guides will be expanded as those product features are implemented.</div>
  <a class="page-link" href="https://github.com/NexLab-ceo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Follow development on GitHub ↗</a>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .manifest-section{margin-top:86px;padding-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #2c392d}
  .manifest-title{font:750 clamp(30px,4vw,46px)/1.1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-1.8px;margin:0}
  .manifest-title span{color:var(--green)}
  .manifest-lead{max-width:700px;color:#9aa59a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:16px 0 26px}
  .manifest-lead code,.manifest-card code,.manifest-note code{color:#b8e995;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.92em}
  .manifest-code{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #344335;border-radius:7px;background:#080d09}
  .code-header{height:43px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #263328;background:#101711}
  .code-header>span{display:flex;gap:5px}.code-header i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#52614f}.code-header i:first-child{background:#d17d70}.code-header i:nth-child(2){background:#d6b66e}.code-header i:nth-child(3){background:#8bbd75}
  .code-header b{font:11px var(--mono);color:#d5e1d2}.code-header small{margin-left:auto;font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.8px;color:#71816e}
  .manifest-code pre{margin:0;padding:22px 25px;overflow-x:auto;color:#c3d2c0;font:12px/1.85 var(--mono);tab-size:2}
  .manifest-code code{font:inherit}
  .manifest-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px;margin-top:18px}
  .manifest-card{padding:19px;border:1px solid #2c392d;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111712,#0b0f0c)}
  .manifest-card>span{font:9px var(--mono);letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--green)}
  .manifest-card h3{font:650 15px var(--display);margin:12px 0 7px}
  .manifest-card p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.75;color:#899489;margin:0}
  .manifest-note{margin-top:17px;padding:17px 19px;border:1px solid #46513a;border-radius:6px;background:#101611;color:#a0aca0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8}
  .manifest-note strong{color:var(--green)}
  @media(max-width:560px){.manifest-section{margin-top:60px;padding-top:35px}.manifest-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.manifest-code pre{font-size:10px;padding:17px}.code-header small{font-size:8px}}
</style>
